+## Request 25: Polish renderInvoiceText
+**Status**: ✅ Completed and tested
+
+### What was done
+- Enhanced `renderInvoiceText()` in src/render.js with additional details:
+  - Shows line discount in parentheses for lines with discountPercent > 0
+  - Shows voucher amount (if any) on its own line before total
+  - Shows 'Due: ' line with due date when invoice has one
+  - Shows 'Paid: ' line with total amount paid when there are payments
+- Format improvements:
+  - Discount shown as `(discount: €X.XX)` on line items
+  - Voucher shown as `Voucher: €X.XX` before Total
+  - Due date shown as `Due: YYYY-MM-DD`
+  - Paid amount shown as `Paid: €X.XX` with all payments summed
+- Added 8 new tests for the enhancements:
+  - Line discount display
+  - Voucher display before total
+  - Due date display
+  - Paid amount display
+  - Combined due date and paid amount
+  - Conditional display (no voucher/due/paid when not present)
+  - Multiple partial payments summed correctly
+
+### Output structure (with all enhancements):
+```
+INV-2025-0001
+Customer Name
+qty x Item1 at €X.XX = €total (discount: €X.XX)
+qty x Item2 at €X.XX = €total
+VAT: €X.XX
+Voucher: €X.XX
+Total: €X.XX
+Due: 2025-10-15
+Paid: €X.XX
+```
+
